# One line ending in the repository and on every checkout. The index has
# always been LF; with core.autocrlf=true and no attributes, a Windows
# checkout rewrote every touched file to CRLF on the way back and git
# warned about each one, while macOS CI checked out different bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary content: never normalised, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
